SUMMARY:Kym Whitley
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club\, Bellflower
DESCRIPTION:Five years of laughs calls for somebody legendary---and Kym Whi
 
tley understood the assignment! Celebrate The Stand Up Comedy Club's 5th An
 
niversary with an exclusive night of stand-up featuring the incomparable Ky
 
m Whitley. Known for her fearless\, no-filter humor and razor-sharp wit\, K
 
ym has spent decades stealing scenes on television and stages across the co
 
untry. Now she's bringing that unmistakable energy to our anniversary celeb
 
ration for a night worthy of five hilarious years. Come raise a glass\, mak
 
e some noise\, and celebrate five years of comedy with one of the funniest 
 
women in the game. Grab your tickets before this anniversary party sells ou
 
t! ************************************ SCAM ALERT -- IMPORTANT TICKET INFO
 
RMATION ************************************ To protect our customers\, ple
 
ase DO NOT purchase tickets from third-party sites such as StubHub\, VividS
 
eats\, BoxOfficeTicketSales\, EventTicketCenter\, eTickets\, Ticket-Center\
 
, TicketSales\, or any other unauthorized platforms. These sellers are not 
 
affiliated with us and often charge inflated prices. All tickets purchased 
 
through our official site are WILL CALL ONLY --- they will not be emailed t
 
o you. You will receive a confirmation email after your purchase\, and your
 
 tickets will be available for pick-up at the door on the night of the show
 
. We will never ask you to call a 1-800 number. If you have any questions\,
 
 please call us directly at 562-202-9944. Our ONLY authorized ticketing par
 
tner is TicketWeb\, which is linked directly from our website: TheStandUpCl
 
ub.com. Ticket resale is strictly prohibited. Tickets suspected of being pu
 
rchased for the sole purpose of resale may be canceled at the discretion of
 
 The Stand Up Club. To ensure your tickets are valid\, always purchase dire
 
ctly from TheStandUpClub.com or TicketWeb.com. Stay safe. Don't get scammed
 
. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/kym-whitley-the-stand-up-
 
comedy-club-tickets/14349334
