SUMMARY:A NEW LIFE\, A  NEW SONG An Evening with HOVHANNES JOHN BABAKHANYAN
LOCATION:Catalina Jazz Club\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:Hovhannes John Babakhanyan is an award-winning Armenian actor a
 
nd singer based in Los Angeles. Classically trained at the Komitas State Co
 
nservatory of Yerevan\, he brings a rich\, expressive voice and an actor's 
 
gift for storytelling to jazz standards and timeless pop classics. Singing 
 
in seven languages\, he connects with audiences through music that crosses 
 
cultures and generations. His career spans theater\, film\, television\, an
 
d concert stages\, including more than 50 Hollywood projects and numerous i
 
nternational honors. Each performance reflects his passion for sharing stor
 
ies\, emotion\, and the joy of music. Catalina Jazz Club 6725 West Sunset B
 
lvd. Hollywood\, CA 90028 *Two-item minimum required per person. Tickets & 
 
info: https://catalinajazzclub.com/tm-event/a-new-life-a-new-song-an-evenin
 
g-with-hovhannes-john-babakhanyan/
URL:https://catalinajazzclub.com/tm-event/a-new-life-a-new-song-an-evening-
 
with-hovhannes-john-babakhanyan/
END:VEVENT
